solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 43023, "version": 2, "versionNonce": 1223912229, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1787049683231, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "aN", "hasTextLink": false, "text": "run_torch_training_loop()\n\nRepeats forward -> loss -> backward ->\noptimizer step over tiny train samples.", "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "run_torch_training_loop()\n\nRepeats forward -> loss -> backward -> optimizer step over tiny train samples.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": "", "roundness": null}, {"id": "M16QfxXC", "type": "text", "x": 930, "y": 1240, "width": 395, "height": 100, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#6741d9", "backgroundColor": "#e5dbff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 43024, "version": 3, "versionNonce": 44565931, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1787049683231, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "aO", "hasTextLink": false, "text": "run_torch_forward_pass()\n\nUses TinyGalaxyCNN.forward().\nImage tensor -> logits -> softmax probabilities.\nNo weights change in this helper.", "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "run_torch_forward_pass()\n\nUses TinyGalaxyCNN.forward().\nImage tensor -> logits -> softmax probabilities.\nNo weights change in this helper.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": "", "roundness": null}, {"id": "m89DozaT", "type": "text", "x": 930, "y": 1425, "width": 395, "height": 100, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#6741d9", "backgroundColor": "#e5dbff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 43025, "version": 3, "versionNonce": 1610923653, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1787049683231, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "aP", "hasTextLink": false, "text": "run_torch_checkpoint_round_trip()\n\nsave_torch_checkpoint()\nload_torch_checkpoint()\nprove loaded model gives same prediction.", "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "run_torch_checkpoint_round_trip()\n\nsave_torch_checkpoint()\nload_torch_checkpoint()\nprove loaded model gives same prediction.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": "", "roundness": null}, {"id": "r1TyUN4O", "type": "text", "x": 1375, "y": 1240, "width": 410, "height": 120, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#6741d9", "backgroundColor": "#d0ebff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 43026, "version": 2, "versionNonce": 512759883, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1787049683231, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "aQ", "hasTextLink": false, "text": "predict_from_checkpoint()\n\nloads sample for image_id\nloads checkpoint weights\nruns forward pass\nreturns GalaxyCheckpointPrediction", "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "predict_from_checkpoint()\n\nloads sample for image_id\nloads checkpoint weights\nruns forward pass\nreturns GalaxyCheckpointPrediction", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": "", "roundness": null}, {"id": "oacCY8BC", "type": "text", "x": 1375, "y": 1425, "width": 410, "height": 100, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#6741d9", "backgroundColor": "#ffdddd", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 43027, "version": 2, "versionNonce": 1683269093, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1787049683231, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "aR", "hasTextLink": false, "text": "classify_with_optional_checkpoint()\n\nIf checkpoint config exists and image_id is present,\nlazily imports package inference.\nOtherwise returns stub response.", "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "classify_with_optional_checkpoint()\n\nIf checkpoint config exists and image_id is present,\nlazily imports package inference.\nOtherwise returns stub response.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": "", "roundness": null}, {"id": "iysOMWkD", "type": "text", "x": 60, "y": 1650, "width": 520, "height": 30, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#6741d9", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 43028, "version": 2, "versionNonce": 891082475, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1787049683231, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "aS", "hasTextLink": false, "text": "4. Sequence diagram: runtime flow over time", "fontSize": 24, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "4. Sequence diagram: runtime flow over time", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": "", "roundness": null}, {"id": "byB65q8h", "type": "text", "x": 60, "y": 1710, "width": 800, "height": 191.25, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#fff3bf", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 43029, "version": 3, "versionNonce": 1492164933, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1787049683231, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "aT", "hasTextLink": false, "text": "Training command over time\n\n1. parse CLI args\n2. load manifest rows\n3. create GalaxyDatasetSplits\n4. create TinyGalaxyCNN object\n5. repeat training loop: forward -> loss -> backward -> optimizer.step\n6. evaluate read-only\n7. save/load checkpoint proof", "fontSize": 17, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Training command over time\n\n1. parse CLI args\n2. load manifest rows\n3. create GalaxyDatasetSplits\n4. create TinyGalaxyCNN object\n5. repeat training loop: forward -> loss -> backward -> optimizer.step\n6. evaluate read-only\n7. save/load checkpoint proof", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": "", "roundness": null}, {"id": "ZVC8yTh4", "type": "text", "x": 930, "y": 1710, "width": 820, "height": 191.25, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#ffdddd", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 43030, "version": 2, "versionNonce": 1691926923, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1787049683231, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "aU", "hasTextLink": false, "text": "Optional API checkpoint flow over time\n\n1. POST /classify with image_id\n2. read env checkpoint config\n3. lazy import predict_from_checkpoint()\n4. load manifest + image tensor\n5. load saved model weights\n6. forward pass -> probabilities\n7. return ClassifyResponse", "fontSize": 17, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Optional API checkpoint flow over time\n\n1. POST /classify with image_id\n2. read env checkpoint config\n3. lazy import predict_from_checkpoint()\n4. load manifest + image tensor\n5. load saved model weights\n6. forward pass -> probabilities\n7. return ClassifyResponse", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": "", "roundness": null}, {"id": "CHCmzjzl", "type": "text", "x": 60, "y": 1990, "width": 420, "height": 30, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#6741d9", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 43031, "version": 2, "versionNonce": 53883045, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1787049683231, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "aV", "hasTextLink": false, "text": "5. OOP and lazy import notes", "fontSize": 24, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "5. OOP and lazy import notes", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": "", "roundness": null}, {"id": "oop-note", "type": "text", "x": 60, "y": 2050, "width": 540, "height": 127.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#d0ebff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 43032, "version": 2, "versionNonce": 385767467, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1787049683231, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "aW", "hasTextLink": false, "text": "OOP in this code\n\nDataclasses = simple objects carrying fields between functions.\nTinyGalaxyCNN = object with behavior forward() and state\nweights.\nScripts use objects instead of loose dictionaries.", "fontSize": 17, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "OOP in this code\n\nDataclasses = simple objects carrying fields between functions.\nTinyGalaxyCNN = object with behavior forward() and state weights.\nScripts use objects instead of loose dictionaries.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": "", "roundness": null}, {"id": "xqIvszc4", "type": "text", "x": 650, "y": 2050, "width": 560, "height": 127.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#ffdddd", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 43033, "version": 2, "versionNonce": 550687749, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1787049683231, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "aX", "hasTextLink": false, "text": "Lazy import in the service\n\nNormal stub mode avoids importing checkpoint/PyTorch code.\nOnly checkpoint config + image_id triggers package inference\nimport.\nThis keeps default Docker path lighter.", "fontSize": 17, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Lazy import in the service\n\nNormal stub mode avoids importing checkpoint/PyTorch code.\nOnly checkpoint config + image_id triggers package inference import.\nThis keeps default Docker path lighter.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": "", "roundness": null}, {"id": "5yZhGpec", "type": "text", "x": 1260, "y": 2050, "width": 500, "height": 127.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#e5dbff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 43034, "version": 2, "versionNonce": 695737035, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1787049683231, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "aY", "hasTextLink": false, "text": "Run/observe notes\n\nUse run_me_observe_results.md to run the current\nscripts.\nUse concepts_explanations.md for weights, logits, loss,\nbackward, optimizer, and checkpoint ideas.", "fontSize": 17, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Run/observe notes\n\nUse run_me_observe_results.md to run the current scripts.\nUse concepts_explanations.md for weights, logits, loss, backward, optimizer, and checkpoint ideas.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": "", "roundness": null}], "appState": {"viewBackgroundColor": "#ffffff"}, "files": {}}